- **`copy_path`** remains the sole file-copy primitive and is called from both the non-recursive path and `_copy_tree`, preserving the semantic anchor.
- **`_copy_tree`** is the only new helper; it handles directory recursion, symlink recreation, and delegates regular-file copies to `copy_path`.
