- **Self-copy / descendant detection** uses `os.path.realpath` on both source and effective destination before any filesystem mutation.
- **Symlink handling in recursive mode**: `os.lstat` determines type; symlinks are always recreated via `os.readlink`/`os.symlink` and never followed, preventing cycles.
- **New directory modes** are set to `src_rwx & ~0o022`; existing directories are left untouched.
